<title>USA: Norstan to resell Venturian service.</title>
<headline>Norstan to resell Venturian service.</headline>
<dateline>HOPKINS, Minn. 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venturian Software, a subsidiary of Venturian Corp, said Monday it had signed a partnership agreement for Norstan Inc to resell Venturian's Internet call center service, CyberCall.</p>
<p>Norstan designs and installs integrated voice video and data services. Venturian's CyberCall allows companies to establish virtual call centers through their World Wide Web sites.</p>
<p>Venturian Software markets advanced computer telephony services to businesses throughout North America.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312 408 8787</p>
</text>
